      "writtenOn": "2025-02-25T20:41:34Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "That would make things quite a bit more complex, and it\u0027s not 100% clear that it would be a gain. If we add the IV into encrypted_data, then at the end of this function we would need to remove the iv, which would be a memmove call (as the source and destination would overlap). It\u0027s not obvious that\u0027s better.\n\nGiven impending deadlines, I don\u0027t think this is worth micro-optimizing.",
